          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"services.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Offerings</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg1:#0f1724;--accent:#7be4c7;--muted:#9aa6b2;--card:#0b1220}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,\\\"Noto Sans\\\",sans-serif;color:#e6eef3;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1),#07101a);}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;padding:22px 28px;color:var(--muted);position:relative;z-index:6}\\n    nav a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px}\\n    nav a.primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#4fd1c5);color:#022;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(12,30,40,.35)}\\n    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\\n    .brand{font-weight:700;color:#dffbf0}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:center;padding:48px 0}\\n    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:26px;border-radius:14px;backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}\\n    h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,40px);color:#e9fff7}\\n    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px}\\n    .services-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .service{padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .service h3{margin:0 0 6px 0;color:#ddfff6}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    .svg-bg{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;opacity:.18;pointer-events:none}\\n    .testimonial{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .avatar{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#9be1d7);flex-shrink:0}\\n    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .btn{padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:none;cursor:pointer}\\n    .btn.primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#5fe0c9);color:#042;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(67,241,203,0.12)}\\n    footer{padding:30px 0;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;font-size:14px}\\n    .faq{margin-top:22px}\\n    .faq-item{margin-bottom:12px}\\n    .lead-magnet{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:18px}\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:18px}.services-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}.wrap{padding:18px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <svg class=\\\"svg-bg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 1200 800\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"xMidYMid slice\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden>\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n        <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#0ff2d6\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/>\\n        <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#6ddbd1\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.06\\\"/>\\n      </linearGradient>\\n      <filter id=\\\"blur\\\"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\\\"30\\\"/></filter>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect x=\\\"-200\\\" y=\\\"-100\\\" width=\\\"600\\\" height=\\\"600\\\" rx=\\\"80\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" filter=\\\"url(#blur)\\\" transform=\\\"rotate(-12 200 200)\\\"/>\\n    <circle cx=\\\"1000\\\" cy=\\\"200\\\" r=\\\"260\\\" fill=\\\"#3ee5c4\\\" opacity=\\\"0.06\\\"/>\\n    <g fill=\\\"#9fe9d9\\\" opacity=\\\"0.04\\\">\\n      <circle cx=\\\"980\\\" cy=\\\"620\\\" r=\\\"150\\\"/>\\n      <rect x=\\\"640\\\" y=\\\"520\\\" width=\\\"340\\\" height=\\\"200\\\" rx=\\\"30\\\"/>\\n    </g>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\" style=\\\"position:relative;z-index:5\\\">\\n    <nav>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\"></div>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\" class=\\\"primary\\\">Offerings</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Concerns</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Method</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <header class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>Thoughtful, whole-person care for everyday wellness</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">We blend time-tested natural approaches with up-to-date science to support resilience—physical, emotional, and energetic. Learn options, get clear plans, and reclaim steadiness.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">\\n          <strong>Signature services</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"services-list\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n              <h3>Integrative Consult (60–75m)</h3>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Comprehensive intake, lifestyle review, and an individualized pathway.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n              <h3>Follow-up & Tuning (30–45m)</h3>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Shorter, focused sessions to refine plans and habits.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n              <h3>Herbal & Nutritional Guidance</h3>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Evidence-informed dietary and botanical suggestions as supportive tools.</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n              <h3>Mind-Body Coaching</h3>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Breath, movement, sleep hygiene and stress-resilience practices.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"cta-row\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"btn primary\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n            <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Message us</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Concise intake</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Not a one-size-fits-all checklist: expect a guided conversation about your rhythm, stressors, digestion, sleep, and goals.</p>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <strong>Retail add-ons</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Gentle, curated supplements and botanical blends are available as optional support when appropriate.</p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Phone</div>\\n              <div>{{PHONE}}</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Email</div>\\n              <div>{{EMAIL}}</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\">\\n          <strong>Testimonials</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"testimonial\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"avatar\\\" aria-hidden></div>\\n              <div>\\n                <div style=\\\"font-weight:600;color:#eafff6\\\">\\\"A steady hand and practical tools\\\"</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"muted\\\">I felt heard and left with manageable steps. — {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, client</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">How sessions unfold</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"muted\\\">A flexible rhythm built around assessment, education, and small sustainable changes.</div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:200px\\\" class=\\\"service\\\">\\n          <h3>Step 1 — Intake</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Detailed conversation about history, sleep, digestion, stress, and labs if available.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:200px\\\" class=\\\"service\\\">\\n          <h3>Step 2 — Personalized plan</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Dietary, lifestyle, and optional botanicals; clear goals and measurable checkpoints.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:200px\\\" class=\\\"service\\\">\\n          <h3>Step 3 — Follow-up</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Adjustments, troubleshooting, and progressive habit-building.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"card faq\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Questions people ask</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\"><strong>Do you prescribe medication?</strong>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">We focus on non-pharmaceutical strategies and collaborate with prescribers when medical management is needed.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"faq-item\\\"><strong>Are lab tests required?</strong>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Not always. Labs are optional and used as educational tools when they add clarity.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <strong>Free resource</strong>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0 0\\\">Download our short guide: \\\"5 Practices for Resilient Days\\\" — practical steps you can try tonight.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"btn primary\\\" href=\\\"/assets/lead-magnet.pdf\\\">Download PDF</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">No guarantees are made; information is educational and individualized care may vary.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"conditions.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Common Concerns</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--dark:#041018;--accent:#b6ffd9;--soft:#a7b8c1}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#03101a 0%,#071726 100%);color:#e6f8f0}\\n    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;padding:18px 0;color:var(--soft)}\\n    nav a{color:var(--soft);text-decoration:none}\\n    nav a.focus{color:var(--accent)}\\n    .svg-wrap{position:fixed;right:-60px;top:-40px;z-index:0;opacity:.14}\\n    h1{margin:10px 0 6px 0;font-size:30px}\\n    .intro{color:var(--soft);margin-bottom:18px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:16px}\\n    .concern{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.025)}\\n    .concern h3{margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#eafff7}\\n    .muted{color:var(--soft);font-size:14px}\\n    .disclaimer{margin-top:18px;color:#d6eae2;font-size:13px}\\n    .cta{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .btn{padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;color:#042;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#a3ffe0,#7be8cf)}\\n    footer{margin-top:28px;color:var(--soft);font-size:13px}\\n    @media(max-width:720px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <svg class=\\\"svg-wrap\\\" width=\\\"420\\\" height=\\\"420\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 420 420\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden>\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id=\\\"lg2\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n        <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#8ff6d1\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.22\\\"/>\\n        <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#66e3c2\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.06\\\"/>\\n      </linearGradient>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect x=\\\"20\\\" y=\\\"20\\\" width=\\\"360\\\" height=\\\"360\\\" rx=\\\"90\\\" fill=\\\"url(#lg2)\\\"/>\\n    <g opacity=\\\"0.05\\\" fill=\\\"#9fe9d9\\\">\\n      <circle cx=\\\"60\\\" cy=\\\"340\\\" r=\\\"48\\\"/>\\n      <circle cx=\\\"360\\\" cy=\\\"80\\\" r=\\\"68\\\"/>\\n    </g>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <nav>\\n      <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\"></div>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Care & Services</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\" class=\\\"focus\\\">Concerns</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">How I Work</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <h1>Common concerns people bring</h1>\\n    <p class=\\\"intro\\\">Below are frequent patterns we explore through education, lifestyle tools, and non-pharmaceutical supports. These descriptions are informational—not promises of outcomes. Personalized plans are developed collaboratively.</p>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"concern\\\">\\n        <h3>Stress & Overwhelm</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Chronic stress manifests as irritability, poor focus, muscle tension, and sleep disruption. Interventions include breathwork, pacing, sleep hygiene, and grounding routines.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"concern\\\">\\n        <h3>Difficulty Sleeping</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Trouble falling or staying asleep can be tied to routines, tech habits, stress hormones, or environment. We review habits, sleep biology, and gentle strategies to shift rhythm.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"concern\\\">\\n        <h3>Digestive Upset</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Bloating, irregularity, reflux or discomfort are approached by evaluating food patterns, stress-related motility changes, and supportive nutrition or botanicals when careful review indicates.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"concern\\\">\\n        <h3>Inflammation & Pain</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Low-grade inflammatory patterns or musculoskeletal pain are explored through diet, movement, sleep, and targeted supportive options; we prioritize safety and evidence.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"concern\\\">\\n        <h3>Low Energy & Fatigue</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Energy concerns can be multifactorial—sleep, nutrition, thyroid or iron changes, stress, or lifestyle. We investigate patterns and teach stepwise adjustments to improve sustainable energy.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"concern\\\">\\n        <h3>Transitions & Hormonal Shifts</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Perimenopause, menstrual irregularity, or other transitions are treated as whole-person events—sleep, mood, menstrual health, and lifestyle are considered together.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"disclaimer\\\">\\n      Important: This site provides educational content and general guidance only. We do not promise cures. If you have a medical emergency, contact local emergency services. Individual recommendations will be tailored after a full assessment.\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">How we approach concerns</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Assessment, small experiments, and careful follow-up. We favor measurable, low-burden steps and avoid unnecessary interventions.</div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:220px\\\" class=\\\"concern\\\">\\n          <h3>Education first</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Understand the physiology behind your symptoms so choices feel informed, not random.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:220px\\\" class=\\\"concern\\\">\\n          <h3>Tailored experiments</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Short, reversible trials (diet, sleep tweaks, botanicals) with objective check-ins.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:18px;align-items:center\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Start a conversation</a>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"services.html\\\">See offerings</a>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">Questions? Email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> or call {{PHONE}} • Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--soft)\\\">All care is individualized; results vary and are not guaranteed.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"approach.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — My Approach</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#061320;--teal:#8ff3da;--soft:#b8c9cf}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#dff6f0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#021018)}\\n    .wrap{max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:18px 0;color:var(--soft)}\\n    nav a{color:var(--soft);text-decoration:none}\\n    .hero{padding:18px 0}\\n    h1{margin:0;font-size:28px}\\n    .sub{color:var(--soft);margin-top:8px}\\n    .process{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .step{flex:1;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:16px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .svg-banner{width:100%;height:140px;margin-top:18px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}\\n    .faq{margin-top:18px}\\n    .lead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:18px}\\n    .btn{padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--teal),#5dd8c6);color:#022;text-decoration:none}\\n    footer{margin-top:26px;color:var(--soft);font-size:13px}\\n    @media(max-width:820px){.process{flex-direction:column}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <nav>\\n      <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\"></div>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Studio</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Services</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Concerns</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--teal);font-weight:600\\\">Approach</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <header class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <h1>Curiosity-led, data-informed care</h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"sub\\\">I combine listening, practical education, and stepped plans so you can make decisions with clarity. Labs and supplements are tools—not mandates.</p>\\n\\n      <svg class=\\\"svg-banner\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 1200 200\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden>\\n        <defs>\\n          <linearGradient id=\\\"b1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n            <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#6ef0d6\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.14\\\"/>\\n            <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#3fd6b8\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.06\\\"/>\\n          </linearGradient>\\n        </defs>\\n        <rect width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"200\\\" fill=\\\"url(#b1)\\\"/>\\n        <g fill=\\\"#9fe9d9\\\" opacity=\\\"0.05\\\">\\n          <circle cx=\\\"100\\\" cy=\\\"100\\\" r=\\\"80\\\"/>\\n          <circle cx=\\\"1100\\\" cy=\\\"45\\\" r=\\\"55\\\"/>\\n        </g>\\n        <g fill=\\\"#cff8ee\\\" opacity=\\\"0.03\\\">\\n          <rect x=\\\"420\\\" y=\\\"20\\\" width=\\\"280\\\" height=\\\"160\\\" rx=\\\"24\\\"/>\\n        </g>\\n      </svg>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"process\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Intake — The first conversation</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"sub\\\">A guided review of history, daily rhythms, sleep, digestion, stress patterns, and any current labs or medications.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Collaborative plan</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"sub\\\">We co-create a prioritized, realistic plan with small experiments and measurable goals rather than sweeping changes.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Follow-ups & tuning</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"sub\\\">Regular check-ins to review progress, tweak supports, and troubleshoot barriers; habit momentum is the goal.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Optional labs — educational use</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"sub\\\">When helpful, we may review basic labs (nutrient levels, thyroid, metabolic markers) to inform the plan. Labs are optional and framed as one piece of the puzzle.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Principles I work by</h2>\\n      <ul class=\\\"sub\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 0 18px\\\">\\n        <li>Start with the least invasive, most evidence-aligned steps.</li>\\n        <li>Teach you the \\\"why\\\" so practices are sustainable.</li>\\n        <li>Measure, iterate, and avoid overcomplication.</li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Practical questions</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"sub\\\"><strong>Will I be given a long supplement list?</strong> Not typically. Any supplements recommended are chosen for clear purpose and reviewed regularly.</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"sub\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\"><strong>How soon will I notice changes?</strong> Small habit changes can feel different within days; sustained improvements are often seen after several weeks of consistent practice.</div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"lead\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <strong>Ready to begin?</strong>\\n        <div class=\\\"sub\\\">Book an intake to get a personalized roadmap and immediate, practical steps.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} • {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--soft)\\\">Care is individualized; information here is educational and not a guarantee of results.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
